            "notes": "your first purple should almost always be  [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) but if you have inting teammates who can't hit their shots, go for  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) instead\n\nalways choose  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) before  [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) so you can get full value from your valk after resurrecting\n\nmake sure you shoot the enemies while you are ulting as you don't need to have your staff out to attach the beams. it's tempting to fly in and attack at close range, but i usually prefer to hover around my team and pressure the enemy with damage",
